OL,3,GNEWSAFestival top spot for film
OL,4,Ahonouring talented little sister
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeah McAleer first met her little
OL,7,Fsister, Beldina Odenyo, when she was 13
OL,8,Fyears old and living in Dumfriesshire.
OL,10,F"Bel was my sister but she also felt
OL,11,Flike my baby. She was five or six when
OL,12,Four dad brought her over from Kenya
OL,13,Fwhere we had grown up until our parents
OL,14,Fseparated."
OL,16,F"I think I tried my best as a 13 or
OL,17,F14-year-old to look after her and she
OL,18,Fwas amazing."
