OL,3,GNEWSAFestival top spot for film
OL,4,Ahonouring talented little sister
OL,5,
OL,6,F"She was such a spirit and she loved
OL,7,Fmusic right from the start.  When she
OL,8,Fwas about 12 and I was at university I
OL,9,Fremember her sending me a CD she'd
OL,10,Fmade.
